From 07ba6f593b5da642670f20d1c694a069e2f647c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 12:46:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD review-completion confirmation so patch agents close
 only after yes/no input

Clean reviews should not silently end a patch agent's workflow. The controller asks the reviewed agent chat for an explicit yes/no answer, keeps that answer out of the backend prompt stream, and lets later follow-up text reopen the chat when work continues.
