+When review completes without findings, the controller appends a
+`work-leaf: review complete for <hash>. Is this feature done? yes/no` question to the reviewed
+patch-agent chat and selects that chat. A `yes` or `y` answer records the user line, marks the
+feature done, and closes the chat in the terminal list without sending a backend prompt. A `no` or
+`n` answer records the user line, reopens the feature, and does not send a backend prompt. Any other
+follow-up text reopens the feature and continues through the normal selected-agent send path.
+
